[1m[38;5;231mWhich task changes should generate a notification?[0m

  [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Assigned / reassigned
  [38;5;246mSomeone put a task on you, or took it off you. The highest-signal event; almost always the reason people want [39m
  [38;5;246mnotifications.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Status changed
  [38;5;246mTask moved to in-progress, done, blocked, etc. High signal for followers of work you depend on.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m [38;5;114m[✔][39m Due date changed
  [38;5;246mDeadline moved. Matters most when someone else moves your deadline.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m [ ] Comment added
  [38;5;246mRequires building a comments subsystem first — model, UI, storage. Real scope addition, not just an event type.[39m
